    "statement": "The operational darkness threshold is T_dark ~ 2\u20131000 (radiometric, eps=1e-1..1e-3, C_em=1..1e6). The corrected benchmark (linear sGB source on the g=1.1 M core) reaches T_max = 6.681e+03, exceeding the most conservative threshold by a factor 6.7. Interior photon emission is suppressed by T^-3 = 3.35e-12 in specific intensity and T^-4 = 5.02e-16 bolometrically; massive messengers require an escape boost ~6681. The exact-background-GB source variant reaches T_max = 4.06 (screened exterior charge), below the threshold \u2014 bounding the prescribed-background depth sensitivity and setting the quantitative target for the coupled nonlinear interior."
